Deep Learning basic formula .
Input data > Guess (Prediction) > Mistake check(Loss) , Fix Weights (Learning).
Guess : Model Tukka lgata hh (model(X)).
Mistake : Dekhta hh kitni Galtii hoii (loss = criterian (prediction, y)).
Fix : Apni galti say seekhna (loss.backward() + optimizer.Step())

